Research ai tasks that can be delegated
title end

paragraph start
An AI may search public sources, summarise them in its own words, extract claims with their source, draft evidence pages in the research template, and flag where sources disagree.
paragraph end

paragraph start
An AI may not invent a source, a number or a quote, and may not decide what the brand does. The owner decides.
paragraph end

